---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const sections = [
  ['A programme is only the starting point', 'A one-off workout can tell you what to do today. Ongoing online personal training should also tell you what needs to improve, how progress is measured and when the plan needs adjusting.'],
  ['Useful check-ins need useful data', 'Depending on the goal, this can include training performance, body-weight trends, measurements, progress photos, activity and how consistently the plan was followed. The purpose is not to collect data for its own sake, but to make better decisions.'],
  ['Technique can still be coached remotely', 'Online coaching cannot replace every benefit of being beside you in the gym, but training videos allow a coach to review setup, execution and obvious technique issues. If you need regular hands-on help, 1:1 or hybrid coaching may suit you better.'],
  ['Nutrition support should fit normal life', 'Targets should be practical enough to work around work, family, travel and eating out. A rigid meal list is not automatically better than a flexible structure that still gives you clear calorie and nutrition targets.'],
  ['Communication matters between formal reviews', 'Questions often appear between check-ins. A clear communication channel means smaller issues can be dealt with before they turn into a week of guessing or abandoning the plan.'],
  ['The right coach should reduce confusion', 'The goal is not to make you dependent on constant instructions. Good coaching should help you understand your training, what progress looks like and why a change is being made.']
];

const articleUrl = 'https://kkcoaching.fit/resources/online-personal-training-uk';
const articleImage = 'https://kkcoaching.fit/images/kacper.jpg';
const publishedDate = '2026-08-12T11:10:00+01:00';
const modifiedDate = '2026-08-12T12:00:00+01:00';

const structuredData = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'Article',
      '@id': `${articleUrl}#article`,
      headline: 'How Online Personal Training Works in the UK',
      description: 'A practical guide to online personal training in the UK, covering individual programming, check-ins, nutrition support, technique feedback and progress tracking.',
      url: articleUrl,
      image: articleImage,
      mainEntityOfPage: { '@type': 'WebPage', '@id': articleUrl },
      isPartOf: { '@id': 'https://kkcoaching.fit/#website' },
      inLanguage: 'en-GB',
      datePublished: publishedDate,
      dateModified: modifiedDate,
      author: {
        '@type': 'Person',
        '@id': 'https://kkcoaching.fit/#kacper-kaszowski',
        name: 'Kacper Kaszowski',
        url: 'https://kkcoaching.fit/about'
      },
      publisher: { '@id': 'https://kkcoaching.fit/#business' },
      about: ['Online personal trainer UK', 'Online fitness coach UK', 'Online coaching']
    },
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      '@id': `${articleUrl}#breadcrumb`,
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://kkcoaching.fit/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Fitness Guides', item: 'https://kkcoaching.fit/resources' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Online Personal Training in the UK' }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How Online Personal Training Works in the UK | KK Coaching"
  description="How does online personal training work in the UK? Learn what to expect from programming, check-ins, nutrition support, video feedback and progress tracking."
  lang="en"
  path="/resources/online-personal-training-uk"
  altPath="/pl/resources/trener-personalny-online-uk-jak-to-dziala"
  structuredData={structuredData}
  articlePublishedTime={publishedDate}
  articleModifiedTime={modifiedDate}
>
  <article>
    <header class="article-hero on-dark">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <a class="back" href="/resources">← Fitness guides</a>
        <span class="eyebrow">Online coaching guide</span>
        <h1>How online personal training works in the UK</h1>
        <p class="lead">Online personal training is more than receiving a workout by email. The useful part is the ongoing system around the programme: tracking, feedback, accountability and changes made from what is actually happening.</p>
        <p class="article-meta">By <a href="/about">Kacper Kaszowski</a>, Level 3 Personal Trainer · <time datetime={modifiedDate}>Updated 12 August 2026</time></p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="on-white">
      <div class="container narrow article-body">
        <p>Different coaches structure online services differently, so it is worth checking exactly what is included before you sign up. A strong service should make your next actions clearer, not give you more information to manage.</p>

        {sections.map(([title, body], index) => (
          <section class="point" aria-labelledby={`point-${index}`}>
            <h2 id={`point-${index}`}>{index + 1}. {title}</h2>
            <p>{body}</p>
          </section>
        ))}

        <section class="service-box" aria-labelledby="service-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow">KK Coaching online</span>
          <h2 id="service-heading">What my online coaching includes</h2>
          <p>KK Coaching combines an individual training programme, calorie and nutrition targets, a coaching app, regular check-ins, progress tracking, video technique feedback and WhatsApp support. The service is available across the UK and is not limited by location.</p>
          <a href="/online-coaching" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Explore Online Personal Training</a>
        </section>

        <section class="choice-box" aria-labelledby="choice-heading">
          <h2 id="choice-heading">When online coaching may not be enough</h2>
          <p>If your main problem is learning equipment, exercise setup or gaining confidence in a commercial gym, regular face-to-face sessions can add value. If you are in Cwmbran, compare <a href="/personal-training-cwmbran">1:1 personal training</a> and <a href="/hybrid-coaching">hybrid coaching</a> before choosing.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Want to know if online coaching fits your situation?</h2>
      <p>Tell me your goal, current routine, experience and biggest obstacle. I will explain which coaching option makes the most sense.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Book a Free Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 820px; }
  .article-hero { padding: 72px 0; }
  .article-hero h1 { color: var(--white); font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.7rem); line-height: 1.08; margin: 10px 0 18px; }
  .lead { color: #D0D4D9; font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .back { display: inline-block; color: #C5C9CF; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .article-meta { margin-top: 18px; color: #AEB4BB; font-size: 0.86rem; }
  .article-meta a { color: #F0F2F4; font-weight: 700; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .article-body > p { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--steel); }
  .point { padding: 30px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E1E4E7; }
  .point h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .point p, .choice-box p, .service-box p { color: var(--steel); }
  .service-box, .choice-box { margin-top: 36px; padding: 28px; background: #F5F6F7; border-left: 4px solid var(--red); }
  .service-box .btn { margin-top: 18px; }
  .choice-box a { color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .final-cta { background: var(--red); color: var(--white); text-align: center; }
  .final-cta h2 { color: var(--white); }
  .final-cta p { color: #F5DADD; max-width: 58ch; margin: 0 auto 24px; }
</style>
